                        <li><a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/tree/main/processor/filterprocessor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry Collector: filter processor</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/observability/traces/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare: Workers traces</a> (last verified October 19, 2026)</li>
                        <li><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/observability/opentelemetry-export/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare: Workers OpenTelemetry export</a> (last verified October 19, 2026)</li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/guides/instrumentation-cloudflare-workers">Maple docs: Cloudflare Workers instrumentation</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/concepts/sampling-throughput">Maple docs: Sampling and throughput estimation</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </article>
